- AUTO-UPDATE DATABASE: Whenever you implement a change that alters the database structure (new table, column, enum), you MUST automatically update `docs/ai_context/database_schema.md`.
- AUTO-UPDATE DICTIONARY: Whenever you create a new logical block, module, or background feature (even if it does not have a new UI page), you MUST automatically append it to `docs/ai_context/slovnik_modulu.md` with a short Czech description. Do not wait for the user to ask you to update the documentation.